    "read-only verification of RevenueCat immutable product-binding schema, index and retirement/immutability triggers",
    "read-only verification of immutable paid plan-change receipt schema, indexes and immutable triggers",
    "migration history must include 0001 through 0005 in order before runtime deployment",
    "a paid plan change must bind exact D1-04 payment/order facts to the D1-01 subscription source-version CAS and immutable change receipt",
    "read-only verification of scheduled plan-change receipt schema, indexes and immutable triggers",
    "migration history must include 0001 through 0006 in order before runtime deployment",
    "a scheduled downgrade must preserve the current plan and entitlement until the next billing-cycle payment is verified as successful; failed renewal preserves the pending schedule for retry"
  ],
